      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Endpoint / Anchor Laboratory\n\nA **Port** is the durable semantic endpoint. A **Handle** is a rendered interaction anchor bound to that Port. This graph keeps those concerns visibly separate."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
